    <criterion testable="true">🔴 The ~21 "task 093" comments belonging to OTHER projects are UNTOUCHED — verified by diff. Only the three named files changed.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">A regression test pins create-before-upload and FAILS when the ordering is broken (perturbation shown, with counts, then reverted).</criterion>
