    <criterion testable="true">No wizard ordering changed, no Secure Project UI added or modified, `EntityCreationService`'s method signatures unchanged — verified by diff.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Build green; package typecheck clean; exact test counts reported.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>🔴 RESCOPED 2026-09-21 at owner instruction, after task 115's nine-file repair and task 107's rescope established that this project's POMLs go stale faster than they are executed. 093 is the ELEVENTH such instance found.

This file previously specified: reorder 7 Create wizards, move the IsSecure collection point, and decide between two Secure UI components. The reorder shipped via 076 and is compiler-enforced; the second Secure component was deleted two days BEFORE this task was filed. Executing it as written would have rebuilt working behaviour and risked regressing a closed tenant-isolation fix.

Closing this UNBLOCKS task **047** (its only other dependant is 090).

Owner-deferred and deliberately NOT folded in: secure **matter** provisioning — `provision-project` is project-only, and the owner set matters as a later add-on.</notes>

